# Buyer UI

The user is a buyer, not an engineer. Read SPEC-008, 012, and 013 before redoing
screens. Design system: `docs/design-system/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`.

- Square corners (`border-radius: 0`). One accent: `#c94d43`.
- Figures, codes, and IDs in JetBrains Mono with `tnum`.
- The eval history is **outside the nav**, on purpose (SPEC-010).
- Vocabulary ≠ policies: do not share a screen. The vocabulary is signed by a buyer;
  a policy is approved by the KPI delta (`docs/03-policies.md`).
